<h3><u>Ali ali ali ali</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><b><u><font size=""4""><p>Ali ali ali ali</p>
</font></u></b><p><font size=""4"">To mazhar-e-noor-e-khuda </font></p><font size=""4"">
<p>To sheer e khuda </p>
<p>Us ka nam allah ali </p>
<p>Tera nam ali </p>
<p>Tujh sey pehley asmanoun mein thi sada allah-hu</p>
<p>Aaj har zaban pe tera nam hei </p>
<ol><li>Kalandaroun ki hei sada, ali ali ali ali</li><p>Peghambaroun ney ye kaha, ali ali ali ali</p><p>To hei deen ka rasta, ali ali ali ali</p><p>Tujhe sey mera vasta, ali ali ali ali</p><p>(Ho meri aan ali meri shan ali) x2 Meri aan ali shan ali jan ali haq ali</p><li>Laboun pe ho har ik pal, ali ali ali ali</li><p>Tamam mushkiloun ka hal, ali ali ali ali</p><p>Tera nahi koei badal, ali ali ali ali</p><p>Hai mera fesala atal, ali ali ali ali</p><p>(Ho meri aan ali meri shan ali) x2 Meri aan ali shan ali jan ali haq ali</p><li>Khuda ka to mizaj hei, ali ali ali ali </li><p>Diloun pe tera raj hei, ali ali ali ali </p><p>Tujhe sey appni laj hei, ali ali ali ali </p><p>Ghamoun ka to ielaj hie, ali ali ali ali </p><p>(Ho meri aan ali meri shan ali) x2 Meri aan ali shan ali jan ali haq ali</p><li>Khuda ki to nigah hei, ali ali ali ali </li><p>Rasool khud gavah hei, ali ali ali ali </p><p>Khuda ki jis mien chah hie, ali ali ali ali </p><p>Vohei to meri rah hei, ali ali ali ali </p><p>(Ho meri aan ali meri shan ali) x2 Meri aan ali shan ali jan ali haq ali</p><li>Nasab tera azeem hei, ali ali ali ali </li><p>Raheem hei kareem hei, ali ali ali ali </p><p>To aayat e kareem hie, ali ali ali ali </p><p>Sirat e mustakeem hei, ali ali ali ali </p><p>(Ho meri aan ali meri shan ali) x2 Meri aan ali shan ali jan ali haq ali</p><li>To iesa karsaz hei, ali ali ali ali </li><p>Ghamoun ka chara saz hei, ali ali ali ali </p><p>Khuda ka to hei raz hei, ali ali ali ali </p><p>Hakeekat e namaz hei, ali ali ali ali </p><p>(Ho meri aan ali meri shan ali) x2 Meri aan ali shan ali jan ali haq ali</p><li>Ye keh rahi hie inaama, ali ali ali ali </li><p>Bata rahi hei haal ata, ali ali ali ali </p><p>Suna rahi hie kuol kafa, ali ali ali ali </p><p>Kitab e haq ney keh diya, ali ali ali ali </p><p>(Ho meri aan ali meri shan ali) x2 Meri aan ali shan ali jan ali haq ali</p><li>Bata rahi hei karbala, ali ali ali ali </li><p>Laho mien dubti fiza, ali ali ali ali </p><p>Hussain teera ladla, ali ali ali ali </p><p>Ye keh key deen bacha gaya, ali ali ali ali </p><p>(Ho meri aan ali meri shan ali) x2 Meri aan ali shan ali jan ali haq ali</p><li>Chali jo shah pe churi, ali ali ali ali </li><p>Haram key lab pe tha yehi, ali ali ali ali </p><p>Madad ko aaye ali, ali ali ali ali </p><p>To karbala bhi keh uthi, ali ali ali ali </p><p>(Ho meri aan ali meri shan ali) x2 Meri aan ali shan ali jan ali haq ali</p><li>Iseer jab hoye haram, ali ali ali ali </li><p>Jiger figar mahvey gham, ali ali ali ali </p><p>To is ghari shahe umam, ali ali ali ali </p><p>Ye keh rahy the dam badam, ali ali ali ali </p><p>(Ho meri aan ali meri shan ali) x2 Meri aan ali shan ali jan ali haq ali</p><li>Kahan talak likhy koei, ali ali ali ali </li></ol>

<p>Tumhari shan ya ali, ali ali ali ali </p>
<p>To kiyoun na phir kahien yahi, ali ali ali ali </p>
<p>Anees-o-mazhar abidi, ali ali ali ali </p>
<p>(Ho meri aan ali meri shan ali) x2 Meri aan ali shan ali jan ali haq ali</p></font></p>
